न शौचं नापि चाचारो न सत्यं तेषु विद्यते ॥ ७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4168,\"bb\":3666,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/7/b3666/\",\"body_value\":\"pravṛttiṁ ca nivṛttiṁ ca
