मोहाद्‍गृहीत्वासद्‍ग्राहान्प्रवर्तन्तेऽश‍ुचिव्रता: ॥ १० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4187,\"bb\":3682,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/10/b3682/\",\"body_value\":\"kāmam āśritya duṣpūraṁ
dambha-māna-madānvitāḥ
