pravartante ’śuci-vratāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4188,\"bb\":3683,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/10/b3683/\",\"shadow_value\":\"kāmam – lust; āśritya – taking shelter of; duṣpūram – insatiable; dambha – of pride; māna – and false prestige; mada-anvitāḥ – absorbed in the conceit; mohāt – by illusion; gṛhītvā – taking; asat – nonpermanent; grāhān – things; pravartante – they flourish; aśuci – to the unclean; vratāḥ – avowed.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"kāmam\",\"translation\":\"lust\"},{\"word\":\"āśritya\",\"translation\":\"taking shelter of\"},{\"word\":\"duṣpūram\",\"translation\":\"insatiable\"},{\"word\":\"dambha\",\"translation\":\"of pride\"},{\"word\":\"māna\",\"translation\":\"and false prestige\"},{\"word\":\"mada-anvitāḥ\",\"translation\":\"absorbed in the conceit\"},{\"word\":\"mohāt\",\"translation\":\"by illusion\"},{\"word\":\"gṛhītvā\",\"translation\":\"taking\"},{\"word\":\"asat\",\"translation\":\"nonpermanent\"},{\"word\":\"grāhān\",\"translation\":\"things\"},{\"word\":\"pravartante\",\"translation\":\"they flourish\"},{\"word\":\"aśuci\",\"translation\":\"to the unclean\"},{\"word\":\"vratāḥ\",\"translation\":\"avowed\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4189,\"bb\":3684,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/10/b3684/\",\"body_value\":\"Taking shelter of insatiable lust and absorbed in the conceit of pride and false prestige, the demoniac, thus illusioned, are always sworn to unclean work, attracted by the impermanent.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4190,\"bb\":3685,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/10/b3685/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 16.10\",\"medium_title\":\"Bh